#. i18n: file: protocols/winpopup/ui/wpeditaccountbase.ui:182
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label)
#: rc.cpp:5906
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"\"Install into Samba\" is a simple method to create the directory for the "
"temporary message files and configure your samba server.<br>\n"
"However, the recommended way is to ask your administrator to create this "
"directory ('mkdir -p -m 0777 /var/lib/winpopup') and for you to add\n"
"'message command = _PATH_TO_/winpopup-send.sh %s %m %t &' (substitute "
"_PATH_TO_ by the real path) to the [global] section in your smb.conf."
msgstr ""
"«Instalar en Samba» é un método sinxelo para crear o cartafol dos arquivos "
"temporais de mensaxes e configurar o seu servidor samba.<br>\n"
"Porén, o método recomendado é que lle  solicite ao administrador que cree "
"ese cartafol ('mkdir -p -m 0777 /var/lib/winpopup') e que engada\n"
" 'message command = _PATH_TO_/winpopup-send.sh %s %m %t &' (substitute "
"_PATH_TO_ by the real path) to your smb.conf [global]-section.  "

